Package: eduka-block
Version: 0.4.1-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: STI-MCAS & IDEA <grupoideatl@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-dnspython, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, policykit-1, nftables, ca-certificates, network-manager, dnsmasq-base, squid
Recommends: lxqt-policykit
Installed-Size: 430
Homepage: https://edukasaunos.tl
Description: multilingual web and Squid protection for Edukasaun OS
 Eduka-Block is a lightweight GTK application for parents and teachers.
 Its subtle 3D, theme-adaptive GTK interface combines wildcard DNS, a managed
 /etc/hosts section, persistent nftables rules and periodic smart IP
 synchronization and optional Squid keyword ACLs. The interface includes English,
 Tetum, European and Brazilian Portuguese, and Indonesian.
